# ExecDaat — Cloudflare Pages
# SPA clean-URL routing is handled entirely by the Hono worker (_worker.js),
# which 302-redirects clean paths (e.g. /payments) to the hash router
# (/#/payments). No static _redirects rules are needed here; keeping them
# empty avoids conflicts with the worker for routes whose tab name differs
# from the path (e.g. /swap → dex, /unified-balance → unified).
